x plate names. The important part, the runway, is at the end, and it's truncated. On web, the names
x wrap inside the tray buttons, so the ends are visible.

x (both) there are enough plates that, at one thumb per entry in the tray, they don't all fit
x on the screen.

x (android) Plates scroll a little left to right (I asked for a thumb of scroll), but not up
x and down, nor do they zoom.

x (web) Plates start out zoomed wider than the display (perhaps 100%?), and I can't scroll them onto
x the display. Zoom in works great, but of course I can't get far enough out.

x Many plates and CSups come in two pages ("Continued").  Can we modify the preprocessing to concatenate
x such plates into one long image, so the user experience is "this is a tall piece of paper I can
x scroll through", not "I have to sift through a huge list to select page 2".

------------------------------------------------------------------------------

x If you leave Android app and return, it starts over at the beginning, rather than picking
